static const char *const mp_12_0[] = {
    "# Understanding Recommendations",
    "",
    "How AutoTune calculates correction recommendations.",
    "",
    "## The Basic Algorithm",
    "",
    "AutoTune compares actual AFR to target AFR and calculates a correction:",
    "",
    "```",
    "Error = (Actual AFR - Target AFR) / Target AFR",
    "Correction = Current VE \303\227 (Actual AFR / Target AFR)",
    "```",
    "",
    "### Example",
    "- Target AFR: 14.7",
    "- Actual AFR: 15.5 (lean)",
    "- Error: (15.5 - 14.7) / 14.7 = 5.4\045",
    "- If VE is 75, recommendation: 75 \303\227 1.054 = 79.1",
    "",
    "## Weighted Averaging",
    "",
    "AutoTune doesn't use single readings. It accumulates data:",
    "",
    "1. **Hit count**: Number of samples in this cell",
    "2. **Weighted average**: each sample is weighted by the **Hit weighting** mode (uniform, or by distance to the cell center)",
    "3. **Confidence**: the change is phased in until the accumulated weight reaches **Base weight**; changes smaller than **Min change** are dropped",
    "",
    "The recommendation shown is a weighted average of all samples.",
    "",
    "## Color Coding",
    "",
    "### Recommendation Grid",
    "- (blue) **Blue**: Increase fuel (running lean)",
    "- (red) **Red**: Decrease fuel (running rich)",
    "- Cells without data show the table's own value",
    "",
    "### Intensity",
    "- **Bright**: Large correction needed",
    "- **Dim**: Small correction",
    "- **Neutral**: On target",
    "",
    "## Heat Map Views",
    "",
    "### Hit Weighting and Coverage Maps",
    "Shows data coverage:",
    "- **Bright cells**: Many data points (high confidence)",
    "- **Dim cells**: Few data points (low confidence)",
    "- **Dark cells**: No data",
    "",
    "### Change Map",
    "Shows correction magnitude:",
    "- **Bright cells**: Large recommended change",
    "- **Dim cells**: Small recommended change",
    "",
    "## Hit Count",
    "",
    "Each cell shows its hit count. Instead of a minimum hit count, **Base weight** (Settings) sets how much accumulated weight a cell needs before its full correction is shown; **Min change** hides smaller changes.",
    "",
    "## Filtering Effects",
    "",
    "Samples are rejected if:",
    "- RPM outside filter range",
    "- Coolant temp too low",
    "- TPS changing too fast",
    "- Accel enrichment active",
    "",
    "Filtered samples don't contribute to recommendations.",
    "",
    "## Authority Limiting",
    "",
    "Recommendations are clamped to authority limits:",
    "",
    "```",
    "Final = clamp(Recommendation,",
    "              Current \302\261 Max change,",
    "              Current \302\261 Max change \045 of Current)",
    "then limited to Min / Max cell value",
    "```",
    "",
    "## Interpreting Results",
    "",
    "### Uniform Lean/Rich",
    "All cells same direction suggests:",
    "- Fuel pressure issue",
    "- Sensor calibration error",
    "- Global offset needed",
    "",
    "### Specific Regions",
    "Localized corrections suggest:",
    "- Normal VE variations",
    "- Proper table tuning needed",
    "",
    "### Erratic Recommendations",
    "Random patterns suggest:",
    "- Noisy sensor",
    "- Unstable engine",
    "- Bad data (check filters)",
    "",
    "## When to Apply",
    "",
    "Apply recommendations when:",
    "- \342\234\223 Good coverage across table",
    "- \342\234\223 Consistent readings per cell",
    "- \342\234\223 Heat map shows sufficient hits",
    "- \342\234\223 No warning indicators",
    "",
    "Wait for more data when:",
    "- (!) Sparse coverage",
    "- (!) Recommendations bouncing",
    "- (!) Authority limits frequently hit",
    "",
};
